  Cmn1=UDP Extract Data v2.0\\\\One instance per peer. Wire Packet_Rx and||1
  Cmn2=the four Received_* inputs\\from UDP Broadcast and Receive v2.0.
  Cmn3=||1Do not wire Enable_FB.\\\\Match parameters default to [SKIP]. An||1
  Cmn4=empty override stays [SKIP]\\and does not fall back to the parameter.
  Cmn5=||1Every active field must match.\\A non-match does not clear a peer||1
  Cmn6=that is already held.\\\\Timeout 0s leaves Online_FB high. Any other||1
  Cmn7=time clears the peer when\\matching packets stop. A repeat match||1
  Cmn8=restarts that time.\\\\Peer outputs and Online_FB are written only||1
  Cmn9=when the value changes.\\String outputs are write-only.\\\\Press||1
  Cmn10=F1 for UDP Beacon and Extract v2.0.html. Leave that file next\\to||1
  Cmn11=this module.\\\\-- VERSION HISTORY --\\v2.0  2026-10-18\\- 2026-
  Cmn12=11-03: F1 opens UDP Beacon and Extract v2.0.html, shared with the||1
  Cmn13=beacon\\- 2026-11-02: Peer_* and Online_FB update only when the||1
  Cmn14=value changes\\- Packet_Rx evaluates the snapshot without the settle||1
  Cmn15=delay\\- Online_FB and Timeout. 0s latches until a new match. Any||1
  Cmn16=other time clears\\  the peer when packets stop.\\\\v1.0  2026-09-
